WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Find Order when in the item’s Ordering details or Stock count row.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.125
Step 2: Without an active timed delivery plan, it is based on average weekly usage across the available completed cycles.

3
00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:21.833
Step 3: Above that level, the recommendation is zero. At or below it, the system recommends enough to reach the target, subject to ordering rules.

4
00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:28.042
Step 4: Use your physical stock count and review the suggestion before adding it to the cart.
